oṃ namo vāgīśvarāya||

kāyais tiribhir api khasamaṃ parādyaṃ praṇamatā tadarthasya|
tantrasya mayā kriyate ṭīkā khasamasya khasamiva||

iha vajradharo bhagavān sarvabuddhānāṃ bodhiḥ. sā cāśrayaparāvṛttilakṣaṇā. āśrayaḥ śarīraṃ sa teṣāṃ trividhaḥ. tatra cittasantānalakṣaṇasyāśrayasya yāvat sāṃkleśikadharmabījānāṃ tadvāsanānāṃ dauṣṭulyākhyānām ādhāras tāvad ālayākhyasya paścād āryamārgeṇa niṣprapañcena cirabhāvitena tāsāṃ parikṣayād anālayākhyasya sataḥ pratiṣṭhā dehabhoganirbhāsānāṃ vijñaptīnām itareṣāṃ ca sāṃkleśikānāṃ dharmāṇām utpannām astaṅgamād anutpannānāṃ cātyantam anutpādāt tenātmanā nivṛttiniyamaḥ. viśuddhagaganopamena tu niṣprapañcena prakāśātmanā 'nantena pravṛttiniyamaḥ parāvṛttiḥ. sā buddhānāṃ dauṣṭhulyāśrayaparāvṛttiḥ. saiva teṣām anāsravo dhātur ucyate, anāśravāṇāṃ buddhadharmāṇāṃ bījādhāratvāt. so 'pi mārgas teṣām āśrayaḥ. tasya parāvṛttir laukikena rūpeṇātyantikī nivṛttiḥ, lokottareṇa cātyantikena pravṛttiḥ. sarvadharmatathatāpi teṣām āśrayaḥ. tasya parāvṛttir āgantukasarvāvaraṇaviśuddhir ātyantikī. yeyaṃ buddhānāṃ dauṣṭhulyāśrayasya mārgāśrayasya tathathāśrayasya ca parāvṛttiḥ saiva teṣāṃ bodhiḥ, saiva dharmakāyaḥ. buddhadharmāṇāṃ kāya āśraya iti kṛtvā svābhāvikaḥ kāya ity apy ucyate, tathatāprakāśayoḥ svarūpe 'tyantam avasthānāt. tad ayaṃ buddhabodhilakṣaṇo bhagavān vajradharaḥ prakṛtyā khasamaḥ. prakṛtir asya svābhāvikaḥ kāyaḥ, tena khasama eva, nirābhāsānantasuviśuddhaprakāśānāṃ tathatāsvabhāvatvāt. sāṃbhogikena yady apy ākāravaicityād yathākāra naiva khasamaḥ, tathāpi yathāpratibhāsaṃ khasama eva. dharmakāyo hi khasamena tattvena dharmān anāvṛto 'nubhavati saṃbhogakāyas tathaiva paricchinatti, anubhavasya niṣpandatvāt. kathaṃ ca tathā paricchinatti. grāhyagrāhakatatpratibhāsānām asattayā paricchedāt. tadyathā bālānāṃ ghaṭādyanubhavaniṣpando niścayaḥ sattayā. yathā ca bālānāṃ ghaṭākāraḥ paṭīyān anubhavaḥ sattājalpanam antareṇāpi sattayaiva paricchinatti prāktananiścayābhyāsavāsanābalāt, tathā buddhānām akalpako 'pi saṃbhogakāyaḥ svam ākāram asattayaiva paricchinatti. sa eva paricchedaḥ pratibhāsaśabdenātra vivakṣitaḥ. dvividho hi pratibhāsaḥ saṃvedanam upalakṣaṇaṃ ca. tasmāt saṃbhogakāyo 'pi buddhānāṃ yathāpratibhāsaṃ khasama eva. nirmāṇakāyas tu sutarāṃ khasamaḥ māyākārair api svayaṃ nirmitasya puruṣāder asattayaiva paricchedāt. sa ca vajradharo janakaḥ sarvabuddhānāṃ. te 'pi khasamās tanniṣpandatvād iti siddhātaḥ.

etasmin siddhānte codyam, naiva vajradharo buddhānāṃ janakaḥ, kiṃ tarhi buddhaputraḥ, pañcabuddhamukuṭatvāt. tasya teṣāṃ devīcakrasya ca kāyavākcittayogāt prapañca evāyaṃ prapañcanayapravarttakaś ca. naiva khasamo nāpi khasamanayapravarttaka iti. etac codyaṃ pariharttum āha - pañcabuddhetyādi. atra ślokau - 

iha dvitricatuḥpañcaṣaḍmātraḥ pañcadhā gaṇaḥ|
prāyeṇa dvipadīvṛttaṃ pādas tricaturair gaṇaiḥ||
apabhraṃśas tu bhāṣātra vikāraḥ saṃskṛtasya ca|
pūraṇaṃ hrasvadīrghatvavindudrutavilambitaiḥ||

dvipadīkhaṇḍaṃ vastukam iti paryāyaḥ. tatra prathamāyāṃ dvipādikāyaṃ triganāḥ pādāḥ. ayukṣādaya ādyo gaṇaḥ ṣaṇmātraḥ, dvitīyo dvimātraḥ, śeṣāś caturmātrāḥ. ca śabdo 'luptacakāro bhinnakramaḥ. ho śabdau dvau. eko usa ādeśaḥ. dvitīyaḥ khalu śabdārtham avyayaṃ saṃbodhanārthaṃ vā. hośabdayorokārasya hrasvaṃ pūraṇārtham. tathāhi apabhraṃśe hrasvatvam ardrakṣepa? edotor? yuktavarṇayoś ca yathādarśanam. jai ke vi jai ko vi. jai pi u ityādivat. tatraivaṃ sambandhaḥ pañcabuddhā makuṭāśrayā yasya tribhuvanaṃ ca sāraḥ. athavā strībhuvanaṃ ca sāraḥ. ādibuddhakṛtabhāvasya tasya khalu khasamapracāra iti. mukhṭāśrayā iti mukuṭasthāḥ, yasyeti vajrasatvasya. śrīṇi kāyavākcittaguhyāni yogināṃ maṇḍalasaṃgṛhītāni tribhuvanam athavā strīti yoginyasatāsāṃ bhuvanaṃ maṇḍalaṃ strībhuvanaṃ tac ca yasya sāro vibhavaḥ, vajranayatvāt. yathoktaṃ śrīguhyasamāje -

mohe dveṣe ca rāge ca sadā vajre ratiḥ sthitā|
upāyaḥ sarvabuddhānāṃ vajrayānam iti smṛtam|| Guhyasamāja 18.52
moho dveṣas tathā rāgaḥ sadā vajre ratiḥ sthitā|
upāyas tena buddhānāṃ vajrayānam iti smṛtam||

ṣaṇṇāṃ cakravartinām ādyatvād ādibuddho vajrasatvaḥ. cakravartitvād eva samukuṭaḥ samaṇḍalaś ca sa kṛtaḥ kṛtakaḥ sāṃvṛto bhāvo 'syeti tathoktaḥ. itthaṃbhūtasya sataḥ tasya yo 'yaṃ pracāro vyavahāraḥ saṃvṛtiḥ svakāyavākcittamukuṭabuddhādiḥ sa sarvas tasya khasamaḥ khasamatvena pratibhāsāt. kathamam ākārāṇām asattayā paricchedāt. tasmād ayaṃ bhagavān svayaṃ ca khasamaḥ, khasamasya ca vajranayasya pravartakaḥ. svamukuṭabuddhasaṃvṛtir api tenaiva kṛtā. kiṃ punaḥ sphuraṇabuddhāḥ. tasmāt janaka evāsau buddhānām.

nanu buddhaputro 'py asāv ucyate, tat katham? kadācid bodhisattvarūpatvāt, bodhisattvānāṃ buddhasutatvāt. nanu mantranītau bhagavataḥ kāyavākcittāni maṇḍlaṃ ca bhāvyate. tato nirābhāsasya dharmakāyasya naiva prāptiḥ. tadaprāptau tadāśritayoḥ saṃbhoganirmāṇakāyayoḥ sutarām aprāptiḥ. athānyataiva tasya bhāvanā sā tarhi kathyatām ity āha - jai ityādi. atra gaṇāś caturmātrā eva ayukṣād yaś catvāraḥ. yukṣādayas trayaḥ. e ai iti dvāv apy ekārau hrasvau alpako vinduḥ. ādyena bhāvena cittaṃ nirūpyate. eṣa paramārthasya bhāvaḥ buddhasvabhāvaḥ khalu naiva dṛśyate, nāpi vijñānasvabhāvaḥ. eteneti uttarārdhena vaktavyena bhāvaneti prakāreṇa cittaṃ yogino nirūpyate samādhīyate. eṣā paramārthasya vajrasatvasya bhāvanā, nāto 'nyā. katamena khalu naiva saṃdṛśyate nopalabhyate na kalpyate, nāpi vijñānasya svabhāvabhūta ākāraḥ, ekānekavicārāsahatvāt. tathāhi grāhyagrāhakānupalmbho dvayānupalambharūpasya dharmakāyasya prāptihetuḥ. kāyavākcittabhāvanā tu saṃbhogakāyayoḥ, tasmād eṣaiva tasya bhāvanā kṣiprataraṃ kāyatrayasya prāpaṇād iti.

bhavatu vajradharasyaivaṃ bhāvanā, buddhādīnāṃ tu kathaṃ bhāvenety ata āha - buddha sa ityādi. atra pratipādaṃ catvāro gaṇāḥ ādye pāde prathamau dvitrimātrau yukṣādayaḥ. prathamaḥ ṣaṇmātraḥ, dvitīyo dvimātra śeṣāś caturmātrā. buddhasya vajradharasya ratnaketoḥ saha padmena vṛttasya eteṣāṃ devānāṃ nāsti svabhāvaḥ. ādibuddha ākāśasvabhāvaḥ, buddhasyeti vairocanasya vajradharasyety akṣobhyasya ratnaketor iti ratnasambhavasya padmeneti amitābhena vṛttasyeti karmaṇaḥ amoghasiddher ity arthaḥ. eteṣām iti pañcānāṃ tathāgatānāṃ devānām iti devīnāṃ kulānāṃ ca nāsti svabhāva iti grāhyo grāhakaś ca dvayapratibhāsasyālīkatvāt. yadi dvayam alīkaṃ kiṃ tarhy eṣāṃ nijaṃ rūpam? ādibuddha iti vajradharaḥ. ākāśa iti khasamaḥ dharmakāyalakṣaṇatvāt khasamatvena pratibhāsāt - sa eṣāṃ svabhāvaḥ.

nijarūpaṃ tanniṣpandatvād eṣām upasaṃhartum āha. āi ityādi. atrāpi pratipādaṃ catvāro ganāḥ prathamapāde prathamo ṣaṇmātradvimātrau evaṃ caturthatṛtīye prathamo dvimātraḥ śeṣāś caturmātrāḥ. eva iti eṣā upajja iti pakārasya dvivacanaṃ neṣyate. khaiṃ iti vilambitena trimātraṃ, khaśabdāt svārthe kaḥ svaraśeśatā, tṛtīyaikavacanasya ībhāvo akāralopaś ca. ādidharmasya eṣā utpattiḥ satvā utpadyante khena samānāḥ. bahutve 'py ekavacanaṃ naye kriyate, tatra śāstraṃ pramāṇam. ādi śuddhaṃ padaṃ khasamasamānam. ādidharmo vajrasatvaḥ dharmakāyātmakatvāt. tasyaiṣā khasamaiḥ kāyavākcittair utpattiḥ. aśeṣāvaraṇakṣayād abhivyaktir eva tasyotpattiḥ prāsādabhaṅgād ākāśotpattivat. ākāśam asyotpattau cihnadṛṣṭāntaḥ. tathā coktaṃ śrīparamādye -

ākāśotpādacihnatvād anādinidhanaḥ paraḥ|
sarvavajramayaḥ satvo vajrasatvaḥ paraṃ sukham||

iti. ata eva satvā buddhādaya utpadyante, ākārāṇām asattayā paricchedāt. khena samānāḥ.

nanu yogatantreṣu mahāmudrāsiddhir eva bodhis tasyāḥ khasamaṃ jñānaṃ hetur eva na svabhāvaḥ. tasmāt sarvayogatantraiḥ khasamatantrasya virodha iti ced āha - naya ityādi nīyate vyākhyāyate 'neneti nayaḥ. yena bhagavatā neyārthasūtrānto vyākhyāyate sa nayaḥ. tasminn arthe 'nakṣarārūḍhe 'pi śāstraṃ bhagavataḥ śāsanaṃ pramāṇaṃ kriyate, na tadviparīte.

atha mantramudrādau sākāre jñāne kīdṛśo naya? ityāha - ādītyādi. ādiśuddham ādiśuddhidharmakāyaḥ. tad eva padam ālambanaṃ khasamajñānasamānaṃ khasamaniṣpandānāṃ mantramudādīnāṃ khasamatvena teṣāṃ pratibhāsāt. ata eva sarvatantrānām uttaratantram idam. 

śrīsarvarahasyatantre 'py uktam -

na kiñcid dhetutattvaṃ hi phalatattvaṃ tathaiva ca|
tat tattvaṃ tathtājñānaṃ tatra yogī samācaret||

iti.

hetutattvaṃ cittaprativedhāś catvāra ākāraḥ. phalatattvaṃ ākāraḥ, tadubhayam apy ākārakam asat, tathatājñānam eva tayos tattvaṃ svākārāṇām asattayā paricchedāt. tatra paricchede yogī cared ity arthaḥ. śrīsamāje 'py uktam-

kāyākṣaram anutpannaṃ vākcittamanalakṣaṇam|
khavajrakalpanābhūtaṃ mithyāsaṃgrahasaṃgraham|| Guhyasamāja 17.36

iti. 

na kṣaratīty akṣaraṃ guhyaṃ kāyaguhyaṃ vāgguhyaṃ cittaguhyaṃ tatsarvam anutpannam asvabhāvaṃ ca pratibhāsate. yathākāram asattayaḥ paricchedāt, khavajre dharmakāye dharmadvavānubhūte kalpanābhūtaṃ paricchedātmakaṃ khasamena tattvena sattayā yathākāram asattayā ca paricchedāt. mithyā ca tat sākāratvāt, saṃgrahaś ca tatsamyak paricchedāt, tena saṃgraho 'syeti tathoktam śuddhalaukikajñānasaṃgṛhītam ity arthaḥ. evaṃ tāvat sarvayogatantrasādhāraṇī khasamārthabhāvanoktā.

idānīṃ śrīsamājāditantrair eva sādhāraṇīṃ khasamārthabhāvanāṃ prastotum āha - pañcetyādi. dvipadīdvayaṃ ādyayā tulyagaṇaṃ prathamaś caśabdo 'rthaḥ. dvitīyo 'vadhāraṇārtho bhinnakramaś ca. pañcabuddhamukuṭasyāpi yasya dharma eva svabhāvaḥ. vajrasatvaḥ praṇamyatāṃ tirbhuvanadharmaprabhāvaḥ. kīdṛśaḥ pañcabuddhamukuṭasyāpi dehinaḥ satā yasya dharmakāya eva svabhāvaḥ? dharmakāyasyaiva khasamasya samarasībhūtasarvabuddhadharmamayasya, tayā mūrtyā, tena saṃdarśanāt. punaḥ kīdṛśaḥ? tribhuvanaṃ yoginīcakram. dharmaprabhāvo dharmadeśanā, dharmasaṃbhogalakṣaṇā 'syeti tathoktaḥ. uktaṃ ca vajraśikhare -

tataḥ svābhāvikān kāyān saṃbhogair visṛtaḥ punaḥ|

iti. atra bhāvanaiva pramāṇo vivakṣitaḥ. svakāyavākcittaiḥ tatkāyavākcitteṣu praveśaḥ praṇāmaḥ. praṇāmānusaṃśam āha - vajretyādinā. vajrasatve praṇamyamāne puṇyam api bhavaty anantam. vajrasatvaḥ praṇamyaitāṃl labhyate dharmamahatvaṃ puṇyam apīti. api śabdāj jñānam api. ananatam api yāvatā saṃbhūtasaṃbhāraḥ syāt. bhūyo 'pi praṇamyatāṃ yataḥ praṇāmāl labhyate. dharmamahatvaṃ vajradharamāhātmyam. kvacit pustake mahattvasya sthāne svabhāvaśabdaḥ paṭhyate. tatra yamakānupapattiḥ sa doṣo vyabhicārāt.

dharmakāya eva vajrasattvaśarīratāṃ gacchatīty uktam. tatra dharmakāyo 'sākṣātkṛtaḥ, saṅketena bhāvayitavyaḥ. tam āha- sarvetyādinā. iyam api saiva dvipadī kiṃ tu dvābhyāṃ pādābhyāṃ sarvasattvān paribhāvya kriyate mokṣasvabhāvaḥ. sarvasaṃbuddhān māyāsuratadhvanibhir āhūya tān praveśya hṛdi vilīya kamalodaragatān vibhāvya kriyate mokṣasvabhāvaḥ śaradindudravadhavalaḥ sarvabuddhadharmāṇāṃ samarasībhāvo darmakāyaḥ. 

tataḥ kiṃ kriyata ity āha - vajretyādi. atra caturgaṇāś catvāraḥ pādāḥ. vajrasatvakṛtasarvasavabhāvo mokṣaḥ kriyate dharmasvabhāvaḥ. eṣa ca dharmo 'vinaṣṭasvabhāva iti. kathaṃ tarhi dehīkriyata ity āha - lokenetyādi. lokena hetunā lokārtham ityarthaḥ. kriyate saṃdarśyate 'nyasvabhāvo vajrasattvākāraḥ, yathāsaṅketaṃ vinayais tatpariṇāmatayā pratīteḥ. paramārthas tu dharmakāyaniṣpandabhūtaṃ jñānāntaram eva tadākāram utpadya yathākāram asattayā bhagavataḥ khyātiḥ. ita ūrdhvaṃ saiva dvipadī trigaṇaiḥ pādaiḥ. e cau devīty ataḥ prāk kāa ityādi. atra utpattiprakārāṇāṃ hrasvatvaṃ pūraṇārtham. kāyo vāk tatra cittaṃ (?)bhodharmasyādyutpattiḥ. yogapīṭhaṃ tatra devīcundādharmasyotpattiḥ tasmin vajrasatvotpādane kā tasyotpattiḥ? 

kiṃ cotpattisthānam iti ced āha - kāyo vāk cittam iti trayam idaṃ dharmasya vajrasatvasyādyutpattiḥ. yogasya pīṭhaṃ pratiṣṭhā bhagavatī cundā mahākāyā, tasmin vajrasatvotpattiḥ. kau tasya mātāpitarau kathaṃ cotpattir ityāha - vajjaho ityādi. vajjaho iti vilambitena ṣaṇmātro gaṇaḥ. vajrasya tatra mantrī bhāvayaty ekasvabhāvām. dharmarūpam ālambate cintayati vajrasvabhāvam vajrasyety akṣobhyasya, tasmin yogapīṭhe ekasvabhāvām iti svabhāvāḥ svābhavidyāsaṃyuktatvāt ekā cāsau svabhāvā ca tāṃ dharmarūpam iti mokṣaṃ pūrvavat. vajrasvabhāvaṃ vajrasatvadehotpattim tam evāha - jaṭetyādinā. jaṭāmukuṭena ca maṇḍitaṃ varṇaṃ ca nīlasvabhāvam. vajrasatvasusamādhiṃ bhāvayaty eṣa sa bhāvaḥ. jaṭāmukuṭena ca pañcabuddhavirājitena maṇḍitaṃ bhagavantam, varṇaṃ ca tasya nīlam. evaṃ vajrasatvasya samyaksamādhiṃ bhāvayet. eṣa iti yogī sahabhāvena sabhāvaḥ sādara ity arthaḥ. akṣobhyajaṭāmukuṭaṃ tu bāhyaikaratnacihnaṃ na buddhacihnam.

athākṣobhyasyāpi kim indudravād utpattiḥ? netyāha akka ityādi. akka iti trimātro gaṇaḥ. majjaṭṭhiu iti pañcamātraḥ. arkamaṇḍalam avyasthitāṃ cintayaty akṣarotpattiḥ. akṣararūpaṃ nirvartya cintayati vajrasvabhāvam. arkaḥ sūryaḥ akṣaraṃ nīlahūṃkāram. vajrasatvabījaṃ tu sitahūṃkāraḥ. vajrasvabhāvam iti akṣobhyamūrttim.

varasatvopattir api mantrād evetyāha jalatau ityādi. atra prathamagaṇo drutoccāraṇena caturmātraḥ kartavyaḥ. jalāntajaṃ bhāvayati mantrī ātmano rūpaṃ svabhāvam. vajrasatvam ālambate advayarūpasvabhāvam. jalam indudruvaḥ sa evāntaḥ tattvānāṃ pitroś ca, tasmāj jātam, ātmano rūpakaṃ svabhāvaṃ svadevatābījam ity arthaḥ. taccandramaṇḍalam adhyasthaṃ bhāvayati mantrī tena bījena vajrasatvaṃ bhāvayati. advayamūrtisvabhāvam. katham advayamūrtiḥ? nārtho na jñānam iti pratibhāsāt, svavidyāsaṃyogād vā.

yogam upasaṃharaṃs tatphalam āha - eṣa ityādi. eṣā cittaniṣpattiḥ kathitā vajradhareṇa, yatra tena bhāvena bhāvayati sidhyati cittasvabhāvaḥ. cittaniṣpattiḥ vajradharacittayogaḥ. bhāveneti prakāreṇa bhāvayati vajrasatvam, sa sidhyati vajradharacittasvabhāvaḥ. 

yadi vajradharasyāpi mantrād utpattir aprapañcasamādhau sthitasya dehotpādanāyogāt, tat tarhi tasmāt samādher acoditasyāsya vyutthānam. vikṣepa eva syād anāyakadharmo vety ata āha - ea ityādi. atra pratipādaṃ catvāro gaṇāś caturmātrāḥ. eṣā caturdevo ekasvabhāvā gītena bhāvayati khena sabhāvam. evaṃ dharmakṛtacittasvabhāvaṃ bhāvayati devīṃ mokṣasvabhāvāṃ caturvidhāṃ devīṃ devīcatuṣṭayam ity arhtaḥ. ekasvabhāveti mokṣarūpā, gīteneti vakṣyamāṇena caturgītakena, bhāvo 'bhiprāyaḥ. tadvat taṃ karoti bhāvayati mantrākārasyābhiprāyasyotpādena prabodhayatīty arthaḥ. katamaṃ prabodhayati? khena sabhāvaṃ samānabhāvaṃ khasamaṃ dharmadravam ity arthaḥ. ea śabda evam arthaḥ prākṛtād ānetavyaḥ, prākṛtasyāpy apabhraṃśe praveśāt. janto dvia dvia ityādivat. evaṃ sati yogī dharmadravaṃ kṛtacittasvabhāvaṃ kṛtavajradharamūrti bhāvayati devīmūrtiṃ ca, mokṣasvabhāvāṃ suviśuddhacittaṃ vajrasatvaḥ, suviśuddhā tathatā deveti bhāvaḥ. 

anayā bhāvanayā buddhatvaṃ prāpyate ity asminn arthe ātmānam udāharaṇīkartuṃ kaścid buddhaḥ parṣatsannipatito 'nuktam apy artham āha - vajjasatta ityādi. anayoḥ pādāḥ trigaṇāḥ pīṭhapakārasya dvirvacanaṃ utpattipakārasya dvirvacanābhāvaḥ upattiho iti drutahrasvābhyāṃ caturmātraḥ.

vajrasatvo mayā dṛṣṭo yogapīṭhe ramamāṇo dārāṃ gṛhītvā sakalasamāṃ tiṣṭhati veṣaṃ dhārayan khena sabhāvād bhāvād utpattiḥ. khalu tatra yā dṛṣṭā vajrasatvo 'vagāhate sphārayati buddhān niviṣṭaḥ. dārām iti bhāryāṃ sakalasamām iti bhagavataḥ sarvasamāṃ, yathā hi bhagavān nīlaḥ pañcabuddhālaṅkṛtajaṭāmukutī dakṣiṇena viśvavajradharo vāmena viśvavajrāṅkitaghaṇṭādharaḥ tathaiṣāpi bhagavatī tiṣṭhatīti. ya iti śeṣaḥ veṣaprasādhanaṃ sabhāvād iti samānabhāvāt. bhāvād iti sarvasattvānāṃ sattvād dharmadravād ity arthaḥ. avagāhata iti paricchinatti, tām iti śeṣaḥ.

katham ityāha - sphārayatītyādi. niviṣṭo manasā samāhita ityarthaḥ. vajra ityādi atrāyukyādau trigaṇau, yukyādau dvigaṇau, jjaśabdaḥ kha ca śabdārthaḥ. catuḥsvabhāvaś caturdevīmadhyaniviṣtaḥ, tribhuvanaṃ māyāsvabhāvena praviṣtaḥ. sarvabuddhānāṃ pratyekam anantāḥ kāyavākcittaprabhedās tatkarmabhedāś ca saṃkṣipya catvāri guhyāni kriyante- kāyayuhyaṃ cittaguhyaṃ vāgguhyaṃ karmaguhyaṃ ca. teṣāṃ tathatā yathākramaṃ catasro devyaḥ. tasmāt catuḥsvabhāvā ata eva sitanīlaraktaharitāḥ sakṣiṇena savarṇavajradharāḥ vāmena cakraraktotpalakamalanīlotpaladharāḥ svakulatathāgatālaṅkṛtaratnamukutāḥ tāsāṃ madhye niviṣṭo vajraparyaṅkeṇa tāsām eva māyopamatvena pratibhāsāt. tābhiḥ saṃgṛhītaṃ tribhuvanaṃ tathāgataguhyatrayaṃ māyopamatvena praviṣto 'vagāḍhaḥ paricchinnāḥ. ita urdhvaṃ tisro dvipadikāḥ pratipādaṃ caturgaṇāḥ. tṛtīyā tu dvābhyāṃ pādābhyām. vissavajja ityādi. viśvavajraṃ tatra caturmukhaṃ devasya vajradharasya, tatreti hṛccandre, buddhā api sarvavikurvaṇam etasya ata eva teṣāṃ sphāraṇāt. sphāradbuddhānām upayogam āha - yathā yathā utpadyante. deva iti devabhṛtāḥ. ho ityāmantraṇo buddhānāṃ sarvo vikurvaṇalābhaḥ khalu sa iti śeṣaḥ.

bhavatu viśvavajrasya buddhānāṃ ca vikuvitam, kiṃ vajrasatvasyety ata āha - sabbau ityādi. sarveṣāṃ devānām iti buddhādīnāṃ āma umbhāva. jayantī i tayā utpattiḥ. vajjasattaho iti ḍaso bhāvaḥ. tentati-tatsarvam ity arthaḥ. sarvaṃ tadvajrasatvasyaiva vikurvaṇam iti yāvat, vajrasatvasyaiva tena tenākāreṇa prasavād iti bhāvaḥ. 

ataś ca dīsai sabbaho dharmasahāva|
tihuaṇa sabbaho eṣusahāva||

darvasya viśvavajrāder dharma eva. advayajñānam eva svabhāvo nārtho na jñānam iti paricchedāt. ata eva tribhuvanaṃ yoginīcakraṃ viśvaṃ vā sarvaṃ samagram ekasvabhāvam eva dṛśyata iti vartate. kīḍa ityādi krīḍāṃ kurvan buddhena mayā dṛṣṭas tadyogaiśvaryañ ca sarvā dṛṣṭāḥ. devetyādi. devāṃ vajrasatvādayaḥ teṣāṃ samayas tattvaṃ tad dyotakaḥ paṭalaḥ. ādimuṃ iti ādimaḥ prathamaḥ svārthe kaḥ tasya pākṣika uṃbhāvaḥ. āimauṃ evaṃ vidijjauṃ taḍjauṃ catusthauṃ paścamauṃ.

khasamāyāṃ khasamatantrasya prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ||

kvacit pradeśe devī paṭhyate kvacic caturdevyaḥ. ataḥ sandehanivṛttaye devīsaṃkhyāś catasro devyaḥ pṛcchanti āikkha ityādinā. atrāyujau ṣaṇmātrau yujau daśamātrau, samayo maṇḍalam, ācakṣe devīnām iti sambandhaḥ. tava samayottame kati devyaḥ? sauttama iti he sadottama uttamā pradhānadevo sadā saṃyuktāsminn iti sadottamaḥ. saṅgītakāra āha - tarhi ityādi. iyaṃ trigaṇā, ekena pādena tasmin pradeśe caturgītaka bhāṣate bhagavān. kataḥ atraiva tāsāṃ nāmanirdeśāt. loke ca bahūnāṃ pradhānapūrvakasya kramanirdeśasya pratītatvāt. bhādevyāḥ prādhānyaṃ śāntyādidevīnāṃ ca yathākramaṃ pūrvādidigdaleṣu vṛttir yathā gamyeta na saṃkhyāmātram. suṇṇā iea ityādi. etāni catvāri gītakāni yathākraṃ cittavākkāyaguhyānāṃ māyopamatvadyotakāni. teṣām eva parigrahāya dharmadravasya protsāhakāni. pramitākṣarā cātra vṛttam. asyāḥ pratipādaṃ catvāro gaṇāḥ caturmātrāḥ. prathamatṛtīyau gurvantau, dvitīye madhya eva guruḥ.

śūnyāvivekakṛtadharmasamā bhāśānti mokṣā suṣamā 'samāḥ|
māyās kārye buddhasamāḥ krīḍanti sarve khasamā asamāḥ||

ākārāṇām astaṅgamāc chūnyaś cāsau tata eva bhedānupalakṣaṇād avivekaś ceti śūnyāvivekaḥ. ākāśākaraṇanyāyenotpāditatvāt kṛtasarvabuddhadharmadravarūpatvād dharma eva tribhiḥ pādaiḥ sambodhya devebhyaś codayanti. samā iti tvayaiva tulyās tattathatātmakatvāt. kās tā ityāha - bhā ityādi.  patyuraṅkagatatvānnetyaṃ bhāsata iti bhāvaḥ. caturdevīsaṃgraharūpatvād vā atyarthaṃ bhāsata iti bhāvaḥ. sarvakāyopadravaśamanāc chāntiḥ, sarvacittāvaraṇamokṣaṇāt mokṣā, sarvabuddhadharmaratiprāyaṇāt suśamā. anantanirmāṇair jagadarthakaraṇād asamā. etāḥ pañcadevyo yadi samāḥ kathaṃ tarhi bhādevyādirūpeṇa vicitrā ity ata āha - māyās tv iti. yady api samās tathāpi māyā iti tu śabdārthaḥ. mantrādy adhiṣṭhānāt kāṣṭhādikam asatā gajādirūpeṇa prathamānaṃ māyā, tatsādharmyād devyo 'pi māyāḥ. dharmakāyaniṣpande śuddhalaukike jñāne tāsām asatā vicitrakāyavākcittākāreṇa prakhyānāt. kiṃ nimittaṃ devyo māyā ityāha - kāryaṃ nimittaṃ jagadarthahetoḥ. ataś ca tā buddhasamāḥ buddhaiḥ vajrasatvādibhiḥ samānāḥ. te 'pi hi dharmakāyena samās tanniṣpandaśuddhalaukikajñānasvabhāve saṃbhogakāye vicitrarūpāḥ prakhyānti jagadarthakriyārtham. tataḥ kim ityāha - krīḍantītyādi. sarve khasamā devyo buddhāś ca krīḍanti, sametya viśvārthacaryayā ramante. kiyataṃ kālam ityāha - asamā iti. śamaḥ śāntir vināśaḥ tadabhāvād aśamā nityakāyās tathāgatā iti vacanāt. nityā hi tathāgatās tribhir api kāyaiḥ svābhāvikena prakṛtinityatayā 'nādinidhanatvāt, sāmbhogikenāśaṃsananityatayā anidhanatvāt, nairmāṇikena pravandhanityatayā kvacid vināśe 'pi tad evānyatrotpādāt anyatra cāvasthānāt, mahāraṇyalagnāgniskandhavat. tad evaṃ dharmasaṃbhogasvabhāvasya krīḍācittasya parigrahāya protsāhanā. jagadarthasādhanatvād viśuddhatvān nirūpadravatvāc ca nityatayā atra dhruvakaṃ ṣaḍakṣaro mantraḥ. rulurulubhyoruṭ. māyetyādi.

māyāsvabhāvāḥ kṛtadyotasamāḥ bhāsante tulyaravadharmasamāḥ|
dharmā akrīḍāḥ khasamānāṃ samāḥ asamāgamāṃśāḥ svato vīṇāsamāḥ||

khasamānām iti dharmakāyaprakṛtīnāṃ buddhānāṃ devīnāṃ ca. dharmā iti deśanādharmāḥ samās tair eva, te 'pi khasamāḥ khasamatvena pratibhāsād ity arthaḥ. ata eva akrīḍāḥ na hi khasamāḥ krīḍanti, krīḍā vā kutaḥ khasamaḥ, yatas teṣāṃ māyayā sabhāvāḥ samānarūpāḥ pratibhāsante tathā paricchedāt, tulyaravaḥ pratiśabdaḥ, tadātmakāḥ śabdās tulyaravadharmās taiḥ samāḥ pratibhāsamātratvāt, samāgamaḥ saṃghātaḥ, tadabhāvād asamāgamā aṃśā varṇā eṣām iti, asamāgamāṃśā dharmāḥ varṇānāṃ krameṇoccāraṇād uccaritapradhvaṃsitvāc ca.

asaṃhatāś ca varṇā na vācakā avācakāś ca na dharmāḥ. tasmāt khasamā dharmāḥ. ata eva svataḥ prakṛtyā vīṇāsamā vīṇādhvanisamā avācakaśabdatvān nirabhisandhitvāc ca tasyāḥ. kaa joa samā iti. kaṃ jalaṃ svārthe kaḥ pratyayaḥ. dyotaś candraḥ jalacandrasamā ity arthaḥ. athavā dyotaḥ pradīpaḥ kṛtadyotena samāḥ. andhakāre tamogatasya lokasya jñānālokabhūtā ity arthaḥ. atha tenaiṣāṃ jagadarthasādhanatvaṃ khyāpitam. śeṣeṇa viśuddhatvam, tasmād tvam api vyutthāya dharmān deśayeti samudāyārthaḥ. jo ityādi. 

yo dharmāloka ākāśasamaḥ kurvanti vajrās tasmin rūpasamāḥ|
rūpāvikāmasukhākṣayado jaladhīndratulyabahus tasmin vajram agraḥ||

samarasībhūtaḥ sarvabuddhānāṃ dharma evālokaḥ prakāśarūpatvāt ākāśasamaś ca nirābhāsāt. tasminn āvirbhūya vajrā vajrasatvā vikurvanti satvārthadharmān darśayanti. kiṃ te rūpasvabhāvā nety āha -rūpasamā iti. rūpapratibhāsamātratvena tair ātmanaḥ pariccdhedāt. teṣāṃ vajrāṇāṃ nayo maṇḍalam. tasmin kīdṛśa ity āha - rūpād ityādi. rūpādayaḥ kāmāḥ pañca taiḥ sukham akṣayaṃ tad dadātīti tathoktaḥ. jaladhiḥ sarittaḍāgādiḥ. asminn indraś candras tena tulyaḥ pratibimbasamatvena paricchedāt. tad evaṃ sarva eva khasamā buddhāḥ satvārthāya dehaṃ dehimaṇḍalaṃ ca darśayanti. tasmāt tvam apy ubhayaṃ darśayeti bhāvaḥ. bahu ityādi. bahuyogapīṭhas tatra vajranayaḥ bahurūpadhārī, tatra vajramayaḥ sphārayati satvān ātmasamān, tatra vajro dadāti varān dhātusamān. bahūni yogapīṭhāny asyeti tathoktaḥ. teṣu tadbhāvād vajramayo vajrātmā vajradharo vineyāśayabhedena dhārayati. tatraiva rūpabhedāt sphārayati tata eva sattvān buddhādīnātmasamān prabhāvatas tanniṣpandatvāt tarhi iti taiḥ satvaiḥ vajro vajradharaḥ. deha dadāti, varān iti īpsitān buddhatvādīn dhātusamān iti gotrasamān yathāgotram ity arthaḥ. jei iti kvacit pāṭhaḥ jayati vinayati varadhātūn trisāhasralokadhātūn samatulyakālam ity eṣa tatrārthaḥ. idṛśī parārthakriyā vajradharasya tāṃ pravartayeti bhāvaḥ. evaṃ devīsaṃkhyādijñānāya caturgītakaṃ caturdevībhyo deśayitvā tā eva niyoktum āha - e ityādi. anayoḥ pratipādaṃ catvāro gaṇāś caturmātrāḥ āṇei vajjeti hrasvatvaṃ pūraṇārtham. he caturdevya etadgītaṃ bhaṇitam anena khasame samādhau niviṣṭaṃ codayataś cādhipaṃ ya etadgītaṃ śṛṇoti śabdaśarīreṇa paśyati. ekamanaseti samāhitena gāhate 'thaśarīreṇa cittam asyeti japena manasā. tataḥ kim ityāha - eha ityādi. etadgītam ākāśasamānaṃ tathatā pratibhāsāt. rūpasamānaṃ vajradharam ānayati, tadarthaṃ ca vajramayaṃ dharmadravātmakaṃ cittaṃ paribodhayati, vyutthāpayati, ekasvabhāvena tantraṃ vajranayam ānayati. 

atha vajrasya vajranayasya cotpattau katame mantrā ity āha - vajjapaeṇa ityādi asyāṃ pratipādaṃ trayogaṇāś caturmātrāḥ. vajrapadaṃ vajradharabījaṃ hūṃkāraḥ. tenānyasvabhāvaṃ bhinnaṃ bījam. ekasmād bījāt dharmadravād bhāvayatīti sambandhaḥ. tenaiva dharmadraveṇa hūṃkārapañcakaṃ bhāvayatīty arthaḥ. kiṃ tenety āha - cettety ādi. cittaṃ nīlavajradharaḥ, sa madhyagato yasmin tanmaṇḍalaṃ sarvaṃ bhāvayati. apabhraṃśe hi sarvaśabdasya trīṇi rūpāṇi, rephalope kṛte dvivacanavikalpaḥ. asati dvivacane pūrvasyākārasya dīrghatvaṃ vasya ca hatvaṃ vā. sabba sāva sāha kathaṃ dharmadravād bījapañcakabhāvanety āha - dhamma ityādi. anuṣṭubham idaṃ pathyāvaktaṃ nāma, atra ca.

ladhunī saha na syātāṃ pādeṣu prathamāt pare|
ayujor yoyujor jas tu caturthād akṣarāt pare||

maṇḍalam kūṭāgāraṃ tasya madhyasthaṃ yat padmottamaṃ tsmin bhāvanā tathoktā dharmasya tathā bhāvanā. dhammamaṇḍalam ajjācchapadum uttamabhāvaṇā. tasya cittaa iti. tasya dharmasya cittakaṃ bhedakaṃ bhāvayatīti śeṣaḥ karṇikāyāṃ digdaleṣu ca tasya dharmasya candrārūḍhahūṃkārarūpeṇa pariṇāmāt. tataḥ kiṃ kuryād ity āha - māa ityādi. anayoḥ pratipādaṃ trayo gaṇāḥ māyāsvabhāvasya sarvasya khalu rūpasya nirūpaṇaṃ kuruteti śeṣaḥ. cittasya vajrasvabhāvasyaikasvabhāvaṃ bho cintayata vajranayam. 

nanu cittasya svarūpam eva vajranayo, nāsau māyety ata - cittaho ityādi. ākārāṇām asatvam ekānekasvbhāvavirahāt, tasmāc cittaṃ khena sarūpam. tasya cittanayo 'svabhāvaḥ vajranayasya cittanayaś cittasvarūpato 'svabhāvo 'svarūpaṃ mithyety arthaḥ. 

nanu anyo vajro anyaś ca vajranayaḥ pratibhāsabhedāt tat kathaṃ ekasvabhāvatety āha, ubhaya ityādi. nānāsvabhāvasya nāsti nayo nyāyaḥ khasame prakāśamātre ākārāṇām alīkatvāt. tasmin vihāre sati vajra eva khasamavajradhara eva svabhāvaḥ, śeṣaṃ māyā alīkatvāt. vajjasatta ityādi. anayoḥ pratipādaṃ catvāro gaṇāś caturmātrāḥ. ādyayā kṛtrimākṛtirmaṃ rūpam āha, dvitīyayā cittavāgguhye hevajrasatvatvam ekasvabhāvaḥ. lokanimittaṃ kriyate māyāsvabhāvas tvayeti śeṣaḥ. katham ity āha - sattam ityādi. vinīyante satvā aneneti vinayo mūrtibhedaḥ. satvān bodhayati vinayasvabhāvaḥ. hevajrasatvatvam ekasvabhāva eva prakṛtiḥ. devī bhādevī. vollai vadati vajja vajradharaṃ aḍeguha iti guptaṃ gūḍham, cittavāgguhyam ityarthaḥ. abbhantare iti svahṛdi ramanta uṃ iti ramamāṇaḥ. cittasvabhāvena candramaṇḍalasthaviśvavajrākāreṇa tahija iti hṛdi khalu cittanigūḍha iti viśvavajravaraṭake gopitam. dhammai siddhauṃ iti mantro 'pi sṛṣṭaḥ, sa ca hūṃkāraḥ. spharaṇam adhikṛtyāha - sphāra ityādi. 

ekasyām ayujoraṣṭau mātrāyujor dvādaśa|
aparasyām ayuyoś caturdaśa yujor dvadaśa||

sphārayati vajrohṛnmantraḥ satvān ākāśasvabhāvān māyomapamān. punaḥ saṃharati yasmāc cittasyaikā prakṛtiḥ. cittair nirūpyamāṇe hi yasmān sarvam eva samaṃ tulyaṃ paśyāmi māyopamatvena, punaḥ punaḥ satvān saṃgatān saṃhṛtān ekākārān karomi. anena sarveṇaitad uktaṃ bhavati - iha saptavidhānuttarapūjāśaraṇagamanabodhicittotpādapūrvakaṃ cittamātratām adhimucya, khasamaṃ bodhicittam āmukhīkṛtya oṃ śūnyatājñānavajrasvabhāvātmako 'ham iti adhitiṣṭhet. tadanu cuṭkārajāṃ cundādevīṃ candravad dhavalāṃ caturbhujāṃ samādhimudrayā pātradharām itarabhujām yām akṣamālāpustakadharāṃ jaṭāmukuṭinīṃ vajraparyaṅkeṇa mahāpadmacandre niṣaṇṇāṃ lokadhātupramāṇāṃ vibhāvya, tatkamalakarṇikāyāṃ muktāphalasvacchadhavalāyāṃ dharmodayākāradhāriṇyāṃ bhrūṃkārajavairocanapariṇataṃ paramojjvalapañcaratnamayaṃ kūṭāgāram.

caturasraṃ caturdvāraṃ catustoraṇaśobhitam|
devīcatuṣṭaye cārupūjāgrāpsarogaṇam||
hārārddhahārapaṭṭasrakcāmarādivibhūṣitam|
mārutoddhūtaviśvāgrapatākāghaṇṭānāditam||

dhyātvā, tanmadhye raktakamalam aṣṭadalaṃ vicintya tatkarṇikāsūryamaṇḍale hūṃkāreṇa bhagavantam akṣobhyam indranīlanibhaṃ maṇiratnāṅkajaṭāmukuṭinaṃ kruddham īṣaddaṃṣṭriṇaṃ vicitravastrābharaṇaṃ vajravajraghaṇṭādharobhayabhujāliṅgitasvābhavidyaṃ vibhāvya, māyāsuratadhvaninā digbhyaḥ samākṛṣya, mukhena praveśya tathāgatāt vilīya kamalodaragatān mahāsukhamayāṃś cintayet. tatprabhāvilīnau ca mātāpitarau vilokya tatkamalam indudraveṇaiva buddhānāṃ dharmakāyena pūrṇaṃ paśyet. tadanu śāntiḥ mokṣā suṣamā asamā ceti catasro devatāś caturṣu dvāracandreṣu niṣadya dharmakāyātmakaṃ mahāvajradharaṃ tasmān niṣprapañcamahāmokṣasukhasamādher vyutthāpanārthakaraṇāya caturgītakena codyayeyuḥ.

suṇṇā ieakaa dhammasamā, bhāsanti mokṣasuṣamāasamā|
māyānukampahiṃ buddhasamā kīḍanti sabba khasamā asamā|| 1
māyāsahāvakaajoasamā bhāsanti tullaravadhammasamā|
dhammā akīḍakhasamāṇasamā asamāgamasa sau vīṇasamā|| 2
jo dhama loa ā āsasamā kuvvanti vajja tahiṃ rūvasamā|
rūvādikāmasuhaakampaado jalahindutulla tahiṃ vajjaṇade|| 3
vahajoapīṭa tahiṃ vajjaṇaḍe bahurūvadhāri tahiṃ vajjamaḍe|
phāranti satta aghāṇasamaṃ tahiṃ vajjadei varadhāusamaṃ|| 4

iti gotikāni gotvā catasro devyaḥ svadigdaladraveṣu praviśya vilīya samarasī bhaveyuḥ, gītikānurodhāc ca tena candradraveṇa karṇikā pūrvādidaleṣu candrāsanāḥ pañcahūṃkārā bhaveyuḥ. nīlasitanīlaraktaharitā yathākramaṃ karṇikāhūṃkāreṇa viśvavajraṃ cintayet, pūrvādihūṃkāraiḥ savarṇān pañcasūkavajrān, varaṭakagarbhotpannabījakiraṇaspharaṇair jagaddhitāni kṛtvā tāni vajrāṇi yathāyogaṃ ṣaḍdevatārūpeṇa pariṇameyuḥ. tatra viśvavajrabījapariṇāmo bhagavān vajrasatvaḥ. indranīlanibho jaṭāmukuṭī navayauvano vicitravastrābharaṇo vajraparyaṅkaniṣaṇṇaḥ svābhabhādevīm ubhābhyāṃ viśvavajraviśvavajrāṅkaghāṭādharābhyāṃ pariṣvajya vyavasthito vīraśṛṅgārarasaḥ. pūrvadale sitavajrabījodbhavā śāntiḥ sitavarṇā, dakṣiṇadale nīlavajrabījodbhavā mokṣā nīlavarṇāḥ, paścimadale raktavajrabījodbhavā suṣamā padmarāgavarṇā uttaradale haritavajrabījodbhavā asamā marakatavarṇā. etāś catasro navayauvanāḥ śṛṅgāravīrarasā ratnamukuṭinyo vicitravastrābharaṇāḥ sasmitaṃ bhagavati prekṣitakaṭākṣāḥ dakṣiṇena savarṇapañcasūkavajradharāḥ vāmena cakraraktotpalakamalanīlotpaladharāḥ sattvasya paryaṅkiṇyaḥ. tadanu bhagavato bhādevyāś ca stanāntaracandraviśvavajravaraṭakacandre nīlahūṃkāraṃ kiraṇamālinaṃ dṛṣṭvā oṃ dharmādhātusvabhāvātmako 'ham ity adhitiṣṭhet. śiraḥkaṇṭhahṛccandreṣu praṇavākarahūṃkārān sitaraktakṛṣṇān vicintya mantrair adhitiṣṭhet, oṃ sarvatathāgatakāyavajrasvabhāvātmako 'ham, oṃ sarvatathāgatavāgvajrasvabhāvātmako 'ham, oṃ sarvatathāgatacittavajrasvabhāvātmako 'ham. caturdevīnāṃ stanāntaracandrasthitasavarṇapañcasūkavajravaraṭakacandreṣu svabījaṃ śiraḥkaṇṭhahṛccandreṣu ca praṇavādīn paśyet. tataḥ sarvadevatānāṃ kāyavākcittāni yathātattvaṃ khasamāni yathākāram asatvād anutpannāni niḥsvabhāvāni niścitya gāthayā 'dhitiṣṭhet.

kāyākṣaram anutpannaṃ vākcittapadalakṣaṇam|
khavajrakalpanābhūtaṃ mithyāsaṃgrahasaṃgraham|| Guhyasamāja 17.36

iti.

tato nijabījaprabhābhir daśādiggatabhir jñānamaṇḍalam ānīya purastāt antarikṣe 'vasthāpya svahṛj japtam arghaṃ datvā aḥ hūṃ va horityebhir jñānamaṇḍalam ākṛṣya, praveśya, vaddhvā vaśīkṛtya samayamaṇḍalaṃ tena sahaikībhūtaṃ paśyet. tato hṛnmantrakiraṇākṛṣṭais tathāgataiḥ jñānāmbupūrṇaratnakalaśadhāribhir ātmānaṃ maṇḍalaṃ cābhiṣicyamānam adhimucya, tadambuniṣpannān devatānāṃ mukuteṣu kulatathāgatān paśyet. tatātmano jaṭāmukuṭoparibhagavantam akṣobhyam indranīlanibhaṃ bhūsparśamudrayā sthitaṃ, lalāṭopari vairocanaṃ candranibhaṃ bodhyagrīmudrayā sthitaṃ, dakṣiṇakarṇopari ratnasambhavaṃ kanakavarṇaṃ varadamudrayā sthitaṃ, grīvāpṛṭhopari amitābhaṃ padmarāganibhaṃ samādhimudrayā sthitaṃ, vāmakarṇopari amoghasiddhiṃ marakatābham abhayamudrayā sthitaṃ cintayet. evaṃ bhādevyāś caturdevī ratnamukuṭopari yathākramaṃ vairocanākṣobhyāmitāyuramoghasiddhīn. tato hṛnmantrakiraṇānirgatābhir devībhiḥ spharaṇayogena gaganatalavyāpinībhiḥ bhagavantaṃ saparivāraṃ pūjayet. tato gṛhyapūjayā pañcavīryapūjayā ca vidhivat saṃpūjya, oṃ sarvatathāgatapūjāvajrasvabhāvātmako 'ham ity adhitiṣṭhet. tato gāthātrayeṇa caturdevīmukhair bhagavantaṃ stuyat.

pañcabuddha maui ssaa jassa a tihuaṇasāra|
āibuddhakaabhāvaḍo tassdō khasamapaāra|| 1
pañcabuddhamauita ssaa jassa a dhammasahāva|
vajjasattapaṇavīau tihuaṇadhammapahāva|| 2
vajjasattapaṇavāntaṃ puṇṇa vi hoi ananta|
vajjasattapavijjau labbhai dhammamahanta|| 3

tataḥ paramasukhasamarpitam ātmānaṃ maṇḍalaṃ ca yāvad icchaṃ bhāvayet. tato hṛnmantraraśmimukhebhyaḥ sarvatathāgatān saṃspharya jagattanmayīkṛtya cittasya viśvarūpatāṃ cintayet. punas tān saṃhṛtya cittasyaikasvabhāvatāṃ paśyet. asmin tantre samādhitrayavyavahāro na vidyate, eka evātra samādhir maṇḍalarājāgrī nāma. bhāvanayā khinno mantraṃ japet. viśvavajravaraṭakāntargataṃ hṛdayam eva mantraṃ hūṃ, upahṛdayaṃ vā anurāgayāmi ubhayaṃ vā anurāgayāmi hūṃ, saptadaśākṣaraṃ vā oṃ mahāsukhavajrasatvajaḥ hūṃ vaṃ hoḥ suratas tvaṃ  anyad vā yathārhaṃ mantravidyādikaṃ japet. tataḥ praṇidhānāni kuryāt. samāsatas tu gāthādvayena -

sarvasvaṃ sarvabuddhānāṃ mahāvajrabhṛtaḥ padam|
ebhir labheyaṃ kuśalair labbhaye pañca tajjagat|| 1
caryā saṃbodhaye yā ca saṃbuddhānāṃ ca yā punaḥ|
varṇitā bodhivajreṇa sā caryā tu dvayī mama|| 2

tataḥ savhṛnmantre taskiraṇākṛṣṭaṃ samayamaṇḍalam antarbhāvya tata utthāyātmani svadevatāphaṭakāreṇa bhūtacatuṣṭaye devīcatuṣtayādhimokṣeṇa yathāsukhaṃ viharet.

ayam ārambhaḥ prathamasandhyāyām. sadhyāntare tu jhaṭityātmānaṃ savidyasvadevatārūpaṃ sarvaniṣpannam ālambya svahṛnmantrāt krameṇa catasro devīr utsṛjya yathāsthānaṃ niveśya kāyādhiṣṭhānādi sarvaṃ pūrvavat kuryāt. evaṃ paścimasandhyāyāṃ jñānamaṇḍalaṃ sampūjyārdhyaṃ datvā oṃ vajramurti anena visṛjya ātmarakṣāṃ kṛtvā samayamaṇḍalaṃ svamantre 'ntarbhāvayet. nidrākāle nirābhāsam anantaṃ jñānam āmukhīkṛtya supyāt. caturdevī caturgītacoditaś ca nidrāta uttiṣṭhet. evaṃ pratyarhaṃ kuryād yāvat siddhinimittāni paśyet iti. cittapradhānamaṇḍalaṃ cittamaṇḍalaṃ tad dyotakaḥ paṭalaḥ.

khasamāyāṃ khasamatantrasya ṭīkāyāṃ cittamaṇḍalapaṭalo dvitīyaḥ||

vāṅmaṇḍalaṃ vaktavyam. vāk prajñā cittam upāyaḥ prajñopāyayor advayībhāvo vāṅmaṇḍalam tac ca prajñāpadhānam. tataḥ tadbhādevīprastotum āha - dia ityādi. atra tisṛṇāṃ dvipadikānāṃ pratipādaṃ catvāro gaṇāś caturmātrāḥ. dvijā brāhmaṇās teṣāṃ cāṇḍālāṇāṃ ca tulyasvabhāvaḥ vijñānamātratvāt teṣāṃ bhedakānām ākārāṇām asattvāc ca. anenodāharaṇena buddhena kathito dharmāṇāṃ svabhāvaḥ prakṛtiḥ prakāśamātratā khasamāḥ.

nanu bhāvānām aneko 'pi svabhāvaḥ pratibhāsasiddhaḥ, eko 'pi aprakāśātmanaḥ pratibhāsāyogāt. tat katham ekatvaṃ gīyate na nānātvam ity āha - ea ityādi. ekasvabhāvaś cittamātratā tasya sthitaḥ sadbhāvaḥ paramārthatvāt, nānekasya kalpitatvāt. tasmin sati kathayati vajrī tulyasvabhāvam. udāharaṇāntaram āha - brāhmaṇetyādinā. brāhmaṇakukkurāv ekasvabhāvau. asthnor veśasya ca kaṭakakuṇḍalāder māyābhūtatvāt. vajjapaaṃ iti vilambitaṃ kāryam. vajrapadaṃ dṛḍhaṃ rūpaṃ cittamātratā, tasmin brāhmaṇa kukkurādau satyaṃ paramārthaḥ. atha tatra tulyasvabhāvaḥ kena dṛṣṭa ity āha - mai jo iā mayā dṛṣṭaḥ. udāharaṇāntaram āha - mutta ityādi. devīṃ bhādevīṃ tahiṃ iti tasyām ekasvabhāvatāyāṃ joa sabhāveti vilambitena pūraṇīyam. yogaḥ samādhiḥ. tahiṃ iti tasmin yoge, sabb tumha iti sarvā yūyaṃ catasro devya ity arthaḥ. bhāvena vajrasatvena ekasvabhāvāḥ satyaḥ śobhante. prabhāvyate sandarśayate iti prabhāvaḥ. śarīraṃ ekaśarīrā ity arthaḥ tulla ityādi. asyāṃ pratipādaṃ caturdaśamātrāḥ tulyasvabhāve 'rddhadravatvāt ekamanā ekamantraḥ. vajjo vibuddhyatāṃ vajrasatvo vibudhyatāṃ, ekajana ekākī. mātāpitarau kva gatāv iti ced āha - tahiṃ ityādi. tasmin dharmadrave naṣṭau dveṣatatsvabhāvau akṣobhyatadvidye. addhāṅgeneti arddhaśarīreṇa dharmasya vajrasatvasya prabhāvaḥ prabhāvanā. kecid vākyam evaṃ paṭhanti - addhe aṅge iti teṣāṃ caturthaḥ pādaḥ ṣoḍaśamātraḥ syāt. aparam arddha kim ityāha - vajjadāru ityādi. anayoḥ pratipādaṃ trayo gaṇāś caturmātrāḥ. vajjaho iti hrasvatvena caturmātram, gaṇa iti bilambitena trimātram. vajjadārā iti vajrabhāryā bhādevī tasmin dharmaprabhāvane yoginā doyate vajrasya vajradharasya ekasvabhāvā ekaśarīrā, tenaiva saha svābhayaiva vāmārddhapūraṇāt. kadā tasyotpattir ity āha - vajjaho ityādi. vajrasya dharmadravasya ruṇaruṇāyamānena caturdevīcaturgītakena varṇanaṃ stutiḥ kriyate yāvat tāvat. tad anantaram eva kiṃ dharmaprabhāva iti vartate. atha codakaṃ devocatuṣṭayaṃ kva gacchatīty āha devaho ityādi. devasya vajrasattvasya vāmenordhvena bhādevībhāgenaikīkṛtya tāḥ paśyed ity arthaḥ. 

nanu vajrasatvo 'smābhir bhāvanīyaḥ idaṃ punar anyad eva ca na strī na pumān ity ata - āha vajjasattetyādi. vajrasattva evāyaṃ praṇamyatāṃ bhāvyatām, mama vacanaṃ pramāṇaṃ kriyatām, yasmād aham api sa eva bhagavān iti bhāvaḥ. taduktaṃ bhavati saptavidhānuttarapūjādikrameṇa khasamaṃ bodhicittam āmukhīkṛtya oṃ kāreṇa trisāhasrapramāṇakāyāṃ bhagavatīṃ cudnāṃ vicintya, tatkamalakarṇikāyāṃ vairocanapariṇāmajaṃ kūṭāgāraṃ vibhāvya tanmadhyaraktāṣṭadalakamalakarṇikāsūryamaṇḍale bhagavantam akṣobhyaṃ svābhividyāṅgasaṅginaṃ dhyātvā sarvabuddhān praveśya vilīya kamalodaragatān vilokya tatraiva prajñopāyau vilīya samarasībhūtau dṛṣṭvā caturdevīcaturgītakacoditadharmadravasaṃhārajacandramaṇḍalamadhyotpannaraktahūṃkārajaviśvavajravaraṭake tadbījaṃ vicintya tatpariṇāmaṃ bhagavantaṃ dakṣinārdhena puruṣarūpadharaṃ vāmārdhena bhādevīrūpadharaṃ padmarāganibhaṃ vāme turaṅgastanaṃ vābārddhe lalāṭe alakaśobhitaṃ jaṭāmukuṭinaṃ vicitrābharaṇāmbaraṃ śṛṅgārarasaṃ vicintya catasro devīs tasminn eva vāmārddhe praviśyaikarasībhūtāṃś cintayet. śeṣaṃ pañcabuddhamukuṭādikaṃ yathāyogaṃ pūrvavat. vāṅmaṇḍaladyotakaḥ paṭalas tathoktaḥ.

khasamāyāṃ khasamatantrasya ṭīkāyāṃ vāṅmaṇḍalapaṭālastṛtīyaḥ||

kāyamaṇḍalaṃ vaktavyam. tatra kāyena kāyapuṣṭiḥ paraḥ samayas tam āha - hatthītyādi. anayoḥ pratipādaṃ catvāro gaṇāḥ khasamasvabhāva iti vajrasattvayogavān. joi iti he yogin, bhāvanā cittena sahitam ekāgramana ekamanaḥ. vajradhare ekamanas tena sidhyati. rūve svāṇa iti vajrasattvarūpākāram, rūvasamāṇa iti kvacit pāṭhaḥ, iti rūpasāmyeneti tatrārthaḥ. atha śāntidevīgāthācatuṣṭayena tathatāṃ bhāṣate, tathatāsvabhāvāt tasyāḥ. āsāṃ pratipādaṃ trayo gaṇāḥ. kuṇantau iti kurvatām, ea iti evaṃ yathā vakṣyati. dhammasamā iti dharmāḥ samāḥ. samīau iti samīyantāṃ samyak jñāyantāṃ, bahutve 'py ekavacanam. ea vāra iti, evaṃ vicāro niṣcayaḥ. eṣa devo vajrasattvaḥ vairocanaḥ śāśvataḥ devyaḥ pañca. ete ekasvabhāvāḥ. 

nanv akṣobhya ity ucyatāṃ na tu vairocana ity ata āha - tulla ityādi. samacittasya yogina ekaraso dharmakāyaḥ sidhyati. tato neha satvād akṣobhyāt prabhāva utpādanā, kiṃ tarhi vairocanāt prasiddhaniyamakhaṇḍanena samatādyotanāt. atha vairocanād utpattau ko guṇaḥ? kāyamaṇḍalatattvasaṃhartum āha - vajjasatta ityādi. sarva ete ekasvabhāvāś cintyāḥ. kathaṃ pūrvavac cundākamalakarṇikāyāṃ vairocanapariṇatakūṭāgāramadhyāsanakamale vairocanatatsvābhayāḥ suratodbhavadrave tayor vilaye. utthāya caturdevīvilayānantaraṃ dravaghanībhāvaje candre sitahūṃkārajasya sitavajradharasya bhāvanāt. ekasvabhāvād dharmakāyāt. vajranayo vajrayānam. yogapīṭhasya tarhi ko 'rtha ity āha - cundetyādi. bhāvānāṃ sarvadharmāṇāṃ yaḥ svabhāvaḥ prakṛtiḥ śūnyatā sā cundā. vajrasattvaḥ tatra kiṃ karotīty āha - tasmin yogapīṭhe rūpī sadehaḥ san paśyaty ekaṃ svabhāvaṃ bhāvānāṃ. bhāvaṇa iti bhāvanā, vairocanaḥ śāsvataḥ. deviho iti devyāḥ satyaḥ paramārtho vajrī tasyotpattim utpattir hi kāyena. kāyaś ca śāśvatas tasmāt sa evotpattim ācaṣṭe. katham ity āha - esasī ity ādi. dvipadikādvayaṃ atrāyujau caturdaśāmātrau yujau dvādaśamātrau e iti yogī sasimaṇḍalamajjhaṭiṭau iti dharmadravasaṃhārajasya candramaṇḍalasya madhye sthitaṃ vajrasya vajradharasya mantraṃ vījaṃ sitahūṃkāraṃ vajraṃ vibhāvayaty ekamanāḥ. tena mantreṇa tisṛ iti pratipārśvatrisūcikaṃ dvādaśasūcikam ity arthaḥ. jalantauṃ iti jvalat kavacit pāṭhaḥ. cittai vajjasahāva vajjavibhāvai eamaṇā tisṛi vajjajalantau iti. tatrāpi sa evārthaḥ. kiṃ tu tisṛ iti drutena caturmātraṃ yamakaṃ ca na syāt majjaṭtiauṃ iti madhyasthitaṃ svārthe kaḥ. vajjasahāveti - vajradharamūrttim, emmai iti evaṃ mayā vajranayo vajradharotpattiḥ. dhamauṃ iti dharmāṇām.

khasamāyāṃ khasamatantrasya tīkāyāṃ kāyamāṇḍalapaṭalaś caturthaḥ||

dharmakāyād eva devatotpattir astu kiṃ manreṇety āha - abhāve ityādi. atra trīṇi dvipathadikāni. caturthaṃ trigaṇam. abhāve iti drutoccāraṇāc caturmātraḥ. abhāvo 'vikalpaḥ samādhiḥ, bhāvo dehaḥ na bhāvyate na jalpyate, na hi svapnād api prabudhyamāno 'nutpanna eva vikalpe dhāvati. tadvad dharmakāyād api vinā mantreṇa na dehotpattiḥ. ammaho iti strī sambodhanaṃ bhāvayati nirūpayatīti bhāvo mantraḥ. ea iti evaṃ mantreṇety arthaḥ. dhammanirūvajjau iti dharme nirūpyamāṇe cittād iti mantravyavahṛtād avikalpāt. bhāvo dehaḥ cittahobhāsa ityādinā yukty antaram āha. cittād eva niṣprapañcāt bhāve dehasya nāsti nayo mokṣas tena ca kāreṇena kriyate bhāvo mantraḥ. kuto nāstīty āha - bhāvetyādi, bhāvo dehaḥ tatsvabhāvasya cittasya nāsti nayo mokṣaḥ virodhāt. kīdṛśo nayaḥ? yaś cittasya khasamaḥ svabhāvaḥ, pratiṣṭhādehabhoganirbhāsānāṃ vijñapatīnāṃ saha bījena parikṣayāt. saṃbhāro vedhasāmarthyāt. punaḥ sa eva dehī bhaviṣyatīti ced āha - cittetyādi. mucyamānasya cittaṃ viśeṣeṇa śuddhyati apunar āvṛtyā kṣīyate. kiṃ tat pubbajiha yathāpūrvam uktaḥ prāk bhrāntir bhṛntinimittapratibhāsaś cāsīt. tataḥ kim ity āha - kaha ityādi. kathaṃ tasya dehāder apunarāvṛtyā kṣīṇasya bhāvaḥ kriyate, naiva virodhāt. etan tarhi cittasyākāraḥ prakṛtir evāstu. tato viśuddham api cittaṃ dehākāram utpatsyate. atrāha - sijjha ityādi. na cāsau bhāva iti, na cāsau dehaḥ nayaḥ paramārthaḥ sidhyati vāhyaś cittātmako vā ekānekasvabhāvavirahāt. tataś ca cittam ākāśavabhāvam eva ākārāṇām alokatvāt. alīkakhyātiś ca bhrāntiḥ. na ca muktasya cittasya bhrāntir astīti kutas tasya dehaḥ? tasmād dravād dharmakāyād anyad eva tanniṣpandabhūtaṃ vijñānaṃ dehādipratibhāsam utpadyate, svākāram alīkatvenātmānaṃ ca māyopamatvena paricchindānām iti bhāvaḥ. upasaṃharann āha - majjha ityādi. svārthe kaḥ, nirvikalpād vikalpaḥ tato deha iti. anayā yuktyā madhye 'natrāle padaṃ vījākṣaraṃ nirūpakam. evaṃ mantravyavahitāc cittād avikalpāt kriyate bhāvo dehaḥ. evaṃ vajrasatva utpadyate cittamaṇḍaādinānāsvabhāvaḥ. savyasattaparibhāvia kijjai mokkhasahāva ity uktam. sa ca mokṣaś cittamātram aikarasam tatkīdṛśaṃ bhāvyam ity āha - acchauṃ ityādi. asyāṃ pratipādaṃ trayo gaṇāḥ. acchaṃ prakṛtiśuddhatvāt nirmalam āgantukamalakṣayāt. pānīyasāhdarmyāt pānīyaṃprasabdhi sukhadrāvitam ity arthaḥ. tetthaho iti tasmin vajrasatvotpādena. laghusīdhyaṃ bhāventaṃ iti tena bhāvena tena dehīkṛtena. emmai etanmayā. kahi anirutta akathyaṃ kathitam. vacer bhāve ktaḥ. niṣkrāntam uktād iti nirūktam. akathyaṃ vajjarahassa ityādinā samayam āha. asyāṃ caturgaṇāḥ pādāḥ some iti hrasva ekāraḥ. āhāre iti ādau hrasvaḥ someneti bodhicittena bhāva iti svadehaḥ. tahiṃ iti tasmin sati, vajrodakaṃ madyam. evaṃ svabhāvam iti bodhicittasvabhāvam cittasahāva iti vajrasattvayogasthaḥ. dhamma ityādi. anayoḥ pādās trigaṇāḥ. dharmaḥ saṃgho vajrodakam, ity eṣāṃ tulasvabhāvaḥ. vajrodakaṃ hi bodhicittaṃ sa eva dharma āryamārgatvāt, sa eva saṃghaḥ savīryapudgalasaṃgrāhakatvāt. vasādīnāṃ ca tulyasvabhāvo bodhicittam eva prakāśamātratvāt dharmāṇāṃ ākārāṇām alīkatvāt, ḍe de vikriyate bhāvaḥ. abhyāsa āśayo vā yogibhir iti śeṣaḥ. bhakṣyaṃ bhojyaṃ śayanāsanam. sabbau iti sarveṣām eṣāṃ yo 'pi samādhir niruktaḥ dharmadravodbhūtaś cittamaṇḍalādiḥ. tasya ca eka evaṃ vā svabhāvo yuduta bodhicittam. 

athāyam utpanno rūpī vajrasatvaḥ kathaṃ draṣṭavya ity ata āha - buddha ityādi. asyāś caturgaṇāḥ pādāḥ abhāvasyādau dīrghatvaṃ buddheneti bodhanatvena sarvaṃ paśyatā trīṇi kāyavāk cittāni bodhirūpāṇi svabhāvo 'syeti tathoktaḥ. kriyate dṛśyate, paramārthataḥ. kīdṛśaḥ sarvadharmāṇām abhāvaḥ khasamaṃ jñānaṃ svabhāvaḥ prakṛtir asyeti tathoktaḥ ākārāṇām asatvād iti bhāvaḥ. vajro vajradharas tena māyāsvabhāvaḥ kathitas tathāparicchedāt. khasama honti paḍihāi sarūva. yasmāt khasamaḥ san rūpī ca pratibhāti. anye tu caturthapādaṃ na paṭhanti tripādikam etad iti cāhuḥ. māa ityādinā phalam āha. asyāṃ trigaṇāḥ pādāḥ dharmaḥ svabhāvaḥ. māyāsvabhāvaṃ nirūpayatā vajrasya dharmakāyasay krṭaḥ prāg bhāro 'vatāraḥ, avaśyaṃ tatprāpteḥ. viparyaye doṣam āha - satta ityādinā. satvaṃ rūpādisvabhāvaṃ ya enaṃ manyate sa satvasvabhāvaḥ, tasya nāsti nayo dharmakāyaḥ. 

athainaṃ cittam eva manyate tasyāpi cittasyaitad eva sthitaṃ sāraṃ nyāyyaṃ yaduta māyopamatvam ākārāṇam alīkatvāt. spharaṇasaṃharaṇam adhikṛtyāha - ea ityādi. anayoḥ pādāś caturgaṇāḥ. ādo tāvac cittaṃ metuparvatasamaṃ kriyate. unnatavipulaprabhāsuratayā nātivipulaṃ nābhyupannataṃ vikṣepaprasaṅgāt. nāndhakārambhyādhyānasiddhaprasaṅgāt . paścāt taccittam utpadyate. suddhabruddheti kevalaṃ buddhamayaṃ sarvatathāgataspharaṇair vyāpratatvāt, paścāt tac cittaṃ khinnaṃ sat sa mantrī saṃharati. tasmin saṃhāre satī mantrī smarati dhyātati. sarvatathāgatasaṃhāreṇa vajradharasvabhāvaṃ svacittaṃ nirūpayet. paścāc cittaṃ merusamaṃ prajvālayaty ālokapiṇḍarūpeṇa tasminn ālokarāśau vajrasatvarūpeṇa cālayati, taddehakoṭīśatasahasraiḥ pūraṇāt. paścād ākāśarūpaṃ sphārayati. vajradharavapuṣāṃ krameṇa saṃharaṇāt. evaṃ spharaṇasaṃharaṇayoḥ svarūpam ity upasaṃhāraḥ. tathāgatasaṃhārāt tathāgatā eva spharantīti yuktam iti ced āha - sijjha ityādi. atrāyujau trigaṇau yuddhau dvigaṇau tasmiṃś citte sidhyati vajrasatva ekarasena sarvatathāgatasaṃhāreṇa ataś ca spharaṇam apy upapannam. vajradhareṇa spharaṇasya kālam āha - sthira ityādinā. atrāyujau daśāmātrau yujau dvādaśamātrau sthiraṃ sphārayati yogī asthiraṃ naiva sphārayed iti. asmin tantre sulabhā siddhir iti khyāpayituṃ dvipadīṣaṭakam āha - sabbetyādi. atra trigaṇāḥ pādāḥ sarvaṃ satyaṃ yathārutaṃ mayā kathitaṃ atreti śeṣaḥ. siddha prakṛtisiddhatvāt, yānaṃ bodhimārgaḥ sabhāvaṃ sattatvam. 

astu prakṛtisiddham idaṃ yānaṃ cittaṃ tu malinam asmākam iti ced āha - cittetyādi. dvipathakasya dvipādakam etat. cittaṃ mā dūṣayata khasamaṃ prakṛtiśuddhatvāt, samaṃ tasyāḥ prakṛter avikārāt. katham ity āha - yan na vilimpati ko 'pi malaḥ, tasyāṃ prakṛtau malānām āgantukatvāt, ākāśe dhūmatamo'bhratuhinavat. jāi ityādinā devatābalam āha. atra trigaṇāḥ pādaḥ he yoginaḥ eṣā bhagavatī cundā ādisvabhāvā sarvabuddhānutpādayati bhāvite vajraprabhāve. prabhāvanaṃ prabhāva utpādanam. sā ced buddhānutpādayati kiṃ vajradhareṇety ata āha - devītyādi. asyāṃ caturgaṇāḥ pādāḥ. devīnāṃ devasya ca vajradharasya eka eva svabhāvaḥ tasya caitā vibhūtayaḥ buddhais tarhi ko 'rtha ity āha - vajrasatvo bhagavān buddhānām eva prabhāvo vibhavaḥ sāraḥ - dharmakāyasvabhāvatvāt. ata eva samūlaṃ buddhānāṃ kāyadvayasaṃgṛhītānām. anādinidhanatvāc ca dharmakāyasya sa eva mūlam, tad evaṃ vajradharasaṃgṛhītānāṃ tryadhvabuddhānāṃ adhiṣṭhānam iti devatābalam. āśayabalaṃ mantrabalaṃ cāha - aṇuṇaa ityādinā. anunayo manasaḥ sarvasatveṣu hitasukhāśayaḥ. tasya bhāvanā tṛtīyaikavacanasya hebhāvaḥ, tayā ca siddhir avaśyaṃ hūṃkāreṇa cānunayārthena. tasmād abhinnaparyaṅkair ajasramayam eva yogo 'bhyasanīya iti sūcayann āha - hiae a ityādi. atra trigaṇāḥ pādāḥ. ūruśabdasyānte 'pi dīrghaḥ. ūrur mama vyathate pādo mama vyathate ity eṣa ūrupādavitarko moghaḥ phalavighnatvāt, moho vā 'jñānaprabhavatvāt. sa hṛdaye na kriyate hṛdi kartuṃ na yujyate. 

nanu santi vighnās tat kutaḥ siddhir ity ata āha vajjetyādi, indrāgnimayanairṝtādayo daśasu dikṣu bhūtapatayaḥ saparivārāḥ vighnakaśaḥ, trailokyaṃ tasya cakraṃ samūhaḥ tadvajraprabhābhiḥ saṃyamitaṃ hṛdvajranirgatāḥ spharanto jvaladvajrākārā raśmayo vajraprabhāḥ tābhiḥ saṃyamitaṃ nirastam, tato nātra vighnāḥ prabhavantīti bhāvaḥ. krodhadevatāyogair vighnaghāto balīyān iti ced āha - phāra ityādi. atrāpi trigaṇāḥ pādāḥ. sphārayati yogī nabhastalakrodhadevatānāṃ koṭisahasrāṇi vajjaho ekkasahāva iti. vajradharād abhedādhimokṣēṇa punaḥ saṃharaty avaśyaṃ tāni vjrasvabhāvatayaiva. etac ca tantraṃ khasamārthapradhānatvāt tenaiva vyapadiśyate. atas tam evopasaṃhartum āha - cittetyādi. dvipathakam etat. cittasya svabhāvaḥ prakṛtis tathatā. tasyaiva bodhir nayo bodhisattvaṃ na malānām. tatas teṣāṃ kṣaye tadakṣayāt sulabhā bodhiḥ. 

nanu bodhir anantā buddhadarmās te kathaṃ tattvaṃ tasyety ata āha, bodhiho ityādi. bodher nayas tattvaṃ cittasvabhāva eva cittatathataiva, saiva hi buddhānāṃ dharmakāyo buddhadharmāṇām āśrayatvān na tu buddhadharmāḥ. te hi tasya vibhavo na svarūpam. yadi tarhi tathataiva tatvam ubhayoḥ sā ca śūnyatā dvayābhāvaḥ. dvayasya sadā sarvatra cāsatvād atyantābhāvaḥ, śaśiviśāṇavat. na cātyantābhāvo bhāvānāṃ prakṛtiḥ bhavati, nāpi tasyāḥ pratyakṣībhāvo 'prakāśātmakatvād ity ata āha - ubhaya ityādi. bodhicittaṃ ca bodhiś cety ubhayam, tasya svabhāvas tathatā, tasya cittaṃ nayaḥ paramārthaḥ dvayarahitaṃ cittam eva dvayaśūnyatā tanmātrasya bhāvapratyayena nirdeśāt. yadi tarhi cittam eva śūnyatā, cittaṃ cādita eva bhrāntaṃ saiva tasya prakṛtir iti bhrāntir eva bodhiḥ syāt, tac cāyuktam, savāsanasarvabhrāntiparikṣayakṣaṇatvāt. bodhir ity ata āha - cittaho ityādi. āgantukā hi bhrāntis tān nimittāś ca malāḥ. svabhāvas tu cittasya khasama eva prakāśamātratvāt ākārāṇām asatvān, kadācid astamayād api kadācic cāsattayaiva paricchedāt. laukikalokottaratatpṛṣṭhalabdhāsu cittāvasthāsu yathākramaṃ yata evāgantukāmalās tata eva sulabhābodhiḥ. tatrāgantukamalaśuddhiḥ sādhyate prakṛtiśuddhiḥ siddhaiva. 

tantrāntareṣu paṭalāntareṣu ca sādhāraṇo yo 'rthas tasyadyotakaḥ paṭalaḥ||

śrīmat tantraṃ khasamam anayā yan mayābhyarcya vācā
    prāptaṃ puṇyaṃ pariṇataśaraccandrikācārukānti|
tenākṣepaṃ khasamam asamaṃ brahmajainaṃ vrajeyam
    viśvārthāya prabhavati guṇajyotiṣāṃ yatra yogaḥ||
    
khasamāyāṃ khasamatantrasya ṭīkāyāṃ pañcamaḥ paṭalaḥ|| 

samāptā ceyaṃ khasamā nāma ṭīkā|| kṛtir iyaṃ mahāpaṇḍitaśrīratnakaraśāntipādānām||
